@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# Explicit preview compatibility
+
+When an explicit preview request includes code 110, the retained observable
+choice prefers the preview-channel Alder release that carries that code.
+Stable releases remain preferred for requests that do not opt into the
+preview channel.
+
+This behavior supports consumers testing the next Alder API before promotion.
